</description><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 13:52:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Jack Zerby</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/240-jack-zerby</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,width=1200,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/83ffefc4-12e8-4eba-83aa-2833cea00251/Jack_Zerby_thumbnail.png?t=1781142493"/&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jackzerby.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Jack Zerby&lt;/a&gt; 目前是 &lt;a href="http://gumroad.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Gumroad&lt;/a&gt; 的设计主管，也是 &lt;a href="http://dogma.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Dogma&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="http://designfordecks.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Design For Decks&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="http://biddyhq.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Biddy&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="http://getdohq.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;DOHQ&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://Flavors.me?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Flavors.me&lt;/a&gt; 和 &lt;a href="https://www.businessinsider.com/what-is-goodsie-2011-5?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Goodsie&lt;/a&gt; 的创始人。&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;他曾为 &lt;a href="https://vimeo.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vimeo&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://pentagram.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Pentagram&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://frogdesign.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Frog&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://rga.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;R/GA&lt;/a&gt; 等公司工作，并为 &lt;a href="https://teachable.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Teachable&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://americanexpress.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Amex&lt;/a&gt; 和 &lt;a href="https://staked.us/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Staked&lt;/a&gt; 等公司提供咨询。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter → &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/jackzerby?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;twitter.com/jackzerby&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/82cc4dc3-638a-4519-812b-2f7d886e502a/image.png?t=1781142289"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b0d3e3c1-2144-499a-9c87-dfa47ed0db9e/image.png?t=1781142303"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f52ad4d3-6db1-43f2-8909-43f7de552298/image.png?t=1781142317"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/10e73223-99ca-43d5-bc5c-47dc9abef0f8/image.png?t=1781142331"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/bf263210-a906-497a-b49e-a224b5da2dc0/image.png?t=1781142346"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/57f0439f-b599-4d90-8837-1a2823061f7d/image.png?t=1781142360"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jack 的妻子最近重新设计了他的工作空间，也就是你今天看到的这个样子。&lt;a href="https://alovelyliving.com/office-update-featuring-ben-moore-caldwell-green/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby#/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;你可以（而且应该！）在这里查看重新设计背后的更多照片和想法！&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间里有哪些设备？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;绿色的 iMac M1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;MAudio Keystation 61 键 MIDI 钢琴&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;用于播客的 EV RE20 麦克风&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pottery Barn Pittsburgh 站立式办公桌&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://diycandy.com/diy-industrial-pipe-shelving/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;DIY 黑色水管置物架&lt;/a&gt;‍&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;琴叶榕&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.target.com/p/modern-floor-lamp-with-table-brass-threshold-8482/-/A-85606489?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;落地灯&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你最喜欢工作空间里的哪件物品？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我的办公桌绝对是最爱。它有经典复古的感觉，又兼具现代站立式办公桌的好处。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你是如何激发创意的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;在 Spotify 上听 Lo-Fi beats 电台，手机调成静音。喜欢 siteinspire.com 这类网站，但也会去 Barnes and Noble 买一堆各种类别的精美杂志。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你如何管理工作与生活的平衡？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我通过 Notion 管理一切，为当周的所有任务创建工单，并制定每季度的目标。无论发生什么，我都会在 5:30 停止工作，吃晚饭，和家人待在一起直到睡觉。周末不工作有助于理清思绪，防止过度疲劳。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你认为远程工作的主要好处是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;没有干扰，无需通勤，能够围绕要完成的任务来安排我的一天，而不是看我在办公桌前待了多少小时。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1787282573&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=fd1ec894-f391-4e98-9262-7cdd00e472ba&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;由 beehiiv 提供支持&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Jan 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>杰克·雷恩斯</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/252-jack-raines</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Jack_Raines?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Jack Raines&lt;/a&gt; 是一个名为 &lt;a href="https://www.youngmoney.co/subscribe?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Young Money&lt;/a&gt; 的财经博客作者，该博客每周更新两次，拥有31,000名读者。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他还负责编辑 Litquidity 的每日财经通讯 &lt;a href="https://www.execsum.co/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Exec Sum&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;在哥伦比亚商学院攻读MBA学位的同时，他兼顾了以上所有工作。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;趣闻：他曾被挪威驱逐出境，在阿根廷学会了萨尔萨舞，还差点因为一篇 &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jackraines/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;讽刺性LinkedIn帖子&lt;/a&gt; 被商学院开除。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2fbcbb73-0bf8-4377-a108-4ac404a2b846/image.png?t=1781141970"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作区里有什么装备？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;MacBook Pro&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.thexebec.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Xebec（外接双屏显示器）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;蓝牙鼠标&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;手账（不算真正的工作区装备，但总是放在包里）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你最喜欢的工作区物品是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我的Xebec。它便携轻巧，能让我拥有三倍的屏幕显示空间。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你是如何激发创意的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我从不刻意激发创意，而是它来主动找我。创意通常会在健身房、地铁上，或是凌晨一点某个不起眼的小酒吧里突然闪现。每当灵感来袭，我就会给自己发几条简短的灵感笔记，等回到电脑前再回顾。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你如何管理工作与生活的平衡？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;管理好工作与生活平衡的最好方法，就是去做那些你根本不需要刻意平衡的事情。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你典型的写作流程是怎样的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我会坐下来写15分钟，然后打开Twitter找一条想引用的推文，接着在Twitter上拖延20分钟，把手机扔到床上，关掉Twitter，再继续埋头写通讯稿。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1787282573&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=9f5948bf-7675-461c-a892-8a62fe13d825&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;由 beehiiv 提供技术支持&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 08 Feb 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>大卫·海涅迈尔·汉森</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/253-david-heinemeier-hansson</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,width=1200,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/269219fe-657a-455e-9fce-87aaafb183ec/image.png?t=1781141716"/&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://dhh.dk?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;David Heinemeier Hansson&lt;/a&gt;（简称DHH）无需正式介绍，但我们还是要介绍一下。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是&lt;a href="https://rubyonrails.org/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Ruby on Rails&lt;/a&gt;的创造者，这个开源框架已被数十万开发者使用。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是&lt;a href="https://basecamp.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Basecamp&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://www.hey.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;HEY&lt;/a&gt;的联合创始人。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是畅销书作家，与联合创始人&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>